# The canonical situation store: six namespaces, their residency semantics,
# and path edges that let an agent discover cold source without enumerating
# it in the injected graph.
"@context": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/context/v1"
"@id": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/vertex/situation-structure"
"@type": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/ontology/SituationStructure"
label: "The situation structure"
statement: >
  situation/ is the repo's canonical law, current knowledge, and episodic
  history: six namespaces whose complete YAML-LD source bedrock validates.
  AGENTS.md is its resident projection — definition, architecture, current
  risks, Decisions, and compact routing faces for active Plans. Draft,
  completed, and abandoned Plans plus episodic records stay cold under these
  disclosed paths until a task requires them.
path:
  - "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/situation/definition"
  - "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/situation/architecture"
  - "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/situation/risk"
  - "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/situation/plan"
  - "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/situation/record"
  - "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/situation/references"
